    "long_instructions": "## Explore a Chatbot Round 2\r\n\r\nThis chatbot now has additional information you can view, called the **Model Card**. This displays additional information for you, the user, about how the chatbot works.\r\n\r\n### Do This\r\n\r\n1) Read the model card to learn more about how the chatbot works\r\n2) With this new information: try to have a successful conversation with the chatbot\r\n\r\nTest the chatbot! Have a conversation with at least 4 messages, then press the <code style=\"color:white; background-color:#7435b2\">Continue</code> button!",
